# Memory

- Use `AGENTS.md` at the repository root as persistent memory for repo-specific knowledge and context.
- Add important insights, patterns, and learnings there so later sessions keep them.
- Only record knowledge that helps future tasks (structure, commands, conventions). Do not log one-off bug stories.
